> https://bugtrack.alsa-project.org/alsa-bug/view.php?id=5244
> 
> 0x1b is internal speaker
> 0x14 is the green jack
> 0x17 is the grey jack
> 0x18 is the pink jack
> 0x1a is the blue jack
> 
